---
title: Jalapeño Salsa
tags: salsa, streettacos, taqueriasalsa
ai_image: true
---

Roast @jalapeños{250g} with seeds, @white onion{50g}, and @garlic{15g} in a #cookware{pan} until everything is nicely charred. Sauté @squash{70g} separately in a #cookware{pan} until softened.

Add the roasted jalapeños, onion, garlic, sautéed squash, @kosher salt{1tsp}, and @chicken bouillon{1tsp} to a #cookware{blender}. Blend until completely smooth.

With the blender running on low, slowly drizzle in @neutral oil{200ml} in a thin stream to create the emulsion. Adjust the oil to reach your preferred consistency.
